    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the Darkness!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the captivating universe of <i>Monochrome Nemesis</i>,</strong> a die and retry game in black and white pixel art, offering a retro black and white experience. Relentlessly face a formidable knight who gains strength and strategy with each duel. Each victory makes your Nemesis more powerful, ensuring a constant and renewed challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478450/extras/bdb1737cb8569d15691eb3b5c67b9844.avif?t=1739003680\" width=160 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Challenge Seekers</strong>, <i>Monochrome Nemesis</i> is designed for those who seek a true challenge. Each combat demands skill and perseverance, putting your abilities to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game Without Limits, Except Yours</strong>. <i>Monochrome Nemesis</i> is a record game, with no mechanical limits other than your own endurance. How far will you go to defeat your Nemesis?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to take on the ultimate challenge and prove your worth against your Nemesis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created with Godot by an Independent Developer.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478450/extras/fb77a7e86feb2968bcad179f204158c3.poster.avif?t=1739003680\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478450/extras/fb77a7e86feb2968bcad179f204158c3.apng?t=1739003680\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span></p>",
